{"unit_id":"ZChenW__dsh-codex-switch#feature-1","repo":"ZChenW/dsh-codex-switch","commit":"7cde17417e3b2a194eb033b3e419d50ddff17190","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Codex Switch 的功能「Codex 模型接入」：该插件向 DSH 的 LLM 注册 openai-codex 提供器，并将账号连接适配器接到模型调用流程。选择对应模型路由后即可使用 Codex。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/src-CiUpiQRu.js:4015"]}
